Stop being blocked by `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` errors.
Proxy any API or domain in seconds — no config needed.
...
// Prefix the URL with corsproxy.io
const response = await fetch(
"https://corsproxy.io/?key=YOUR_API_KEY&url=" + encodeURIComponent(apiUrl)
